# Reserved for Azure Functions TypeScript v4 (Flex Consumption).
#
# Per `specs/001-azure-stig-dashboard/plan.md` and `tasks.md` (T221, T222,
# T309, T408, T605), this folder will host:
#   - scanOrchestrator/       (Service Bus trigger)
#   - findingsIngestor/       (Event Grid trigger)
#   - exceptionExpirer/       (Timer trigger)
#   - contentRefresher/       (Timer trigger)
#   - poamOverdue/            (Timer trigger)
#
# Each function shares connector and entity types from `backend/src/` and the
# cross-package `packages/shared/` module.
